SUMMARY:Walk Duke Wall/ Dinner at Cosmic Cantina
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nTrying to get out there and enjoy th
 e evening after work by walking Duke Wall.\n\nWe’ll be doing two loops a
 nd on the second one I plan to cut over and get some dinner at Cosmic Cant
 ina. You’re welcome to join for either part of this outing!\n\nWe will m
 eet at the part of the wall across from Sedgefield St. and then will be wa
 lking up Markham towards N. Buchanan around the wall.\n\nYou do just have 
 to street park in the area for this location.
